      "message": "Hi Derek, I think we should first close the discussion on b:296173534. \n\nDo you know why we need CLEAR_AP_IDLE at all? I think AP_IDLE should be cleared naturally whenever it\u0027s consumed. I want to understand we didn\u0027t introduce a flag to control undefined behavior of another flag.",
